# Production build values that are PUBLIC by design — committed on purpose.
# (Secrets never go here: they live in Vercel env vars or Supabase Edge Function Secrets.)
#
# A Vercel Environment Variable of the same name overrides this file, so the key can
# be switched from the Vercel dashboard later without touching the repo.
# Local `npm run build` also reads .env.local, which takes precedence over this file.

